# This portfolio

A one-of-one personal site. Not a clone of Brittany Chiang, not a dark shadcn landing, not an Awwwards starter with the name swapped.

## Stack (lock this)

- Next.js 16 App Router + React 19 + TypeScript strict
- Tailwind CSS v4 + CSS variables for a **custom** token set (not default zinc/slate shadcn theme as the identity)
- GSAP 3.12+ + `@gsap/react` + Lenis 1.x (`lenis/react`) for scroll
- Optional R3F only for one justified WebGL moment
- `next/font`, `next/image`, Metadata API, JSON-LD
- Content as typed data or MDX — statically generated

Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before writing Next.js APIs. Do not invent Pages Router, `getServerSideProps`, or `next/head`.

## Non-negotiables

- Server Components by default. `'use client'` on leaves only.
- Distinct visual thesis before coding UI. Load `frontend-design` and `parallax-portfolio-craft`.
- Layouts are mobile-first (`responsive-layout`). Do not scale a desktop artboard as the mobile strategy.
- Scroll motion uses `nextjs-gsap-lenis`. Do not mix Lenis RAF with a second GSAP ticker.
- Honour `prefers-reduced-motion`. Animate transform/opacity only.
- No Inter/Space Grotesk/Syne as the whole brand. No acid-green-on-black default. No 01/02/03 fake indexes.

## Agent files

Rules = constraints. Skills = workflows. `AGENTS.md` = project facts. Use skills when the task matches their description.